    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix homepage url bugs. Add instructions on setting it up by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/28\r\n* Fix Mangeto base URL redirect problem by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/29\r\n* 34 os agnostic select all by @oootttyyy in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/43\r\n* Improve Evaluation Annotation by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/44\r\n* Fix evaluation annotation for example 301, 302 by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/47\r\n* Improve current viewport filtering by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/39\r\n* Massive PR on many parts by @shuyanzhou in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/54\r\n  * Further fix inaccurate or wrong locators and required_contents in the test data\r\n  * Update evaluation code to deal with corner cases\r\n  * Add support to huggingface models and support generation retry when facing invalid actions\r\n  * Fix bounding box errors for more accurate in-viewport display\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @oootttyyy made their first contribution in https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/pull/43\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/web-arena-x/webarena/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0",
